// The app's Shopify settings. Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig in this same folder and fill it in there.
// Secrets.xcconfig is git-ignored: it stays on this Mac and is never committed.
//
// Where they are: Shopify admin › Sales channels › Hydrogen › SOS CLOSET › Storefront settings › Storefront API
// (the website's public token, since November 7: the Headless channel isn't installed; with Headless, its
// storefront's Storefront API page). Use the PUBLIC access token, never the private one (shpat_…).
//
// Write the store address without "https://": an .xcconfig file reads "//" as the start of a comment.

SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN =
SHOPIFY_STOREFRONT_TOKEN =
